==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should have both a decent defense against Celeboodles and a crit unit. This crit unit can be fodder, just make sure you have one for this stage as Metal One Horn is difficult to beat via brute force.

